    trueStatement:"A guide's popularity was displayed separately from its review status.",falseStatement:"Every household object was presented as a suitable beginner repair project.",absentStatement:"The website charged contributors an annual registration fee.",
    heading:"Keeping commercial recommendations accountable",mainIdea:"Shared practical knowledge becomes reliable through explicit scope, independent testing and continuing maintenance.",inference:"A successful repair by an expert does not establish that the written instructions are sufficient for a novice.",
